# One line ending everywhere: LF in the repository and in the working tree, so a
# Windows checkout of a Rust/TypeScript file is byte-identical to a Linux one and
# diffs stop churning on the files some editors rewrote as CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets that must never be newline-converted (or diffed as text).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
